### 2. Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/scene#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

ex:EgoVehicle rdf:type ex:Vehicle .
ex:Van rdf:type ex:Vehicle ;
       ex:positionedAt ex:RightLane .

ex:Pedestrian_Crossing rdf:type ex:Pedestrian ;
                       ex:action "crossing" ;
                       ex:location "in_front_of_ego_vehicle" .

ex:Pedestrian_Construction rdf:type ex:Pedestrian ;
                           ex:location "left_roadside" .

ex:RoadCone rdf:type ex:Infrastructure .

ex:EgoVehicle ex:approaching ex:Pedestrian_Crossing .
ex:Van ex:occluding ex:RightSidewalk .
```

